<title>JAPAN: DEO DEO corrects 96/97 group current profit.</title>
<headline>DEO DEO corrects 96/97 group current profit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>DEO DEO Corp, a Japanese retailer of consumer electronics, on Tuesday corrected its group current profit for the year to March 31, 1997 to 7.58 billion yen.</p>
<p>It had announced a profit of 7.93 billion yen on May 16. No reason was given for the mistake.</p>
</text>
